<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Dewan Salman profit falls.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Dewan Salman profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sale			 6,291  vs  4,309</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     195  vs    909</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	   163  vs    888</p>
<p>    Final cash dividend   10 pct  vs 20 pct per ten-rupee share</p>
<p>    Bonus issue		  nil  vs    20 pct (two-for-ten)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Dewan Salman Fibre Ltd. Book closure December 18-31. Ex-dividend date December 18. AGM will be held on December 22.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
